> propagated if we had a separate xe_oa_set_property_fn array for the reconfiguration
> case.  Say:
>
> """
> static int xe_oa_set_prop_inval(struct xe_oa *oa, u64 value,
>				  struct xe_oa_open_param *param)
> {
>	return -EINVAL;
> }
